WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.700
The business closes at seven.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.500
The website? No.

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:07.200
HG Studio builds a website that works for you.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.500
A customer builds an event quote on their own, books an appointment,

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.000
and you get it all, organized, on WhatsApp.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.400
A fixed price, and live within two weeks.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.500
Four questions on the site, and that's it.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.900
Want a site like this? Send them a WhatsApp message.
